*.pyc

# macOS and IDE cruft
.DS_Store
.idea/

# Solver output while a benchmark is running. The finished CSVs in kaggle/
# are committed; these are the live logs behind them.
kaggle/logs/
bench.log

# Regenerable by zipping the repo -- no reason to version 6 MB of duplicated
# instances and source.
kaggle/*.zip

# Editor duplicates
*copy*.ipynb

# data/v3 is the abandoned small-family experiment: pendants clustered onto
# 35 hosts to reproduce small-graph's open-twin structure. It matched the
# structure exactly and still did not make the instances discriminating, so
# synth-1..3 kept the original generator. The reasoning is recorded in
# generate_v2.py; the graphs themselves are not used by anything.
data/v3/

# Superseded by kaggle/benchmark-*.csv and kaggle/merged.csv
/benchmark.csv
/results-for-sheet.csv
